{"2025.11.21版:P07-Q11":{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>锰氧化物晶胞与氧空位</title><!--chem-style:3f988976c5a5937e0558eab589702caac8cb68489be57106907d457df806601d--></head><body><main><a class=\"back\" href=\"../../../../%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3.html\">← 返回题库</a><div class=\"eyebrow\">2025.11.21版 · 湖南新高考教学教研联盟2025届第一次考试 · 原题11 · P07-Q11</div><h1>锰氧化物晶胞与氧空位</h1><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag main-tag\">主类别：物质结构与性质/晶体结构与性质/晶体常识</span></div><p class=\"rationale\">分类依据：分析组成密度和价态变化。</p><details><summary>相关知识点</summary><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">认识化学科学/氧化还原反应/氧化还原反应的应用/氧化还原反应有关计算</span><span class=\"tag\">认识化学科学/物质的量/物质的量及单位——摩尔</span></div></details><div class=\"card original\"><details><summary>展开原题题干与配图</summary><div><p>可能用到的相对原子质量：H~1  C~12  N~14  O~16  S~32  Cl~35.5  Mn~55  Co~59  Ni~59  Ag~108</p><p>11. 锰氧化物具有较大应用价值，<img src=\"chem-asset:902e2c674863db6fefc69ecbd264594c33d546752a33ef78b158b87b4525e1ee:0;\" style=\"width:28.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的某种氧化物<img src=\"chem-asset:4642e9bca2123285e4e2e74dd064e20b9467419012146f713b136f6250fdfdf0:1;\" style=\"width:45.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的四方晶胞及其在<img src=\"chem-asset:d2f8591123eaeec6ec7e1104622c186070cdd53ac060fb859acd10a2a883e209:2;\" style=\"width:20.80px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">平面的投影如图所示，当有氧原子脱出时，出现氧空位，设该四方晶胞参数为<img src=\"chem-asset:6db4e448d632d27b238af68256dce21b0c03410d62e61358032833b0a3e243e1:3;\" style=\"width:32.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">、<img src=\"chem-asset:07e95349a24a1a49e7c70b781a171a0a0528446b65fcc4c8aa0f603d24d1e236:4;\" style=\"width:33.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">、<img src=\"chem-asset:06b1d552e8e88515befaaa9de6124ccf027ef512f07bb9abce4e802fdd8dbd5b:5;\" style=\"width:32.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，阿伏加德罗常数的值为<img src=\"chem-asset:d8b68a9d309cf7689d828e2e60d480c3af323d5b1a71bf42f66a9f8d5efced79:6;\" style=\"width:25.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">。下列说法错误的是</p><p><img src=\"chem-asset:fbec49c51c741f071e325b5edbac788fd198d5d57cf9ac65ed03cbe07099991d:7;\" style=\"width:427.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>A. 该锰氧化物的化学式为<img src=\"chem-asset:ae1d18e1336a9c3b14f4aebc67b28d9cf34b0f91d3e2333e66d5932f56820510:8;\" style=\"width:44.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>B. 晶体密度为<img src=\"chem-asset:6e848ec32b91c7995f4ec6fe6a4a4882eac40c2344af2697f65f0b648e3eb955:9;\" style=\"width:146.47px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>C. <img src=\"chem-asset:902e2c674863db6fefc69ecbd264594c33d546752a33ef78b158b87b4525e1ee:0;\" style=\"width:28.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">位于距离最近的O构成的八面体中心</p><p>D. 出现氧空位时，<img src=\"chem-asset:902e2c674863db6fefc69ecbd264594c33d546752a33ef78b158b87b4525e1ee:0;\" style=\"width:28.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的化合价降低</p></div></details><h2>原答案</h2><div class=\"answers\"><p>【答案】B</p></div><h2>原解析</h2><div class=\"analysis\"><p>【解析】</p><p>【详解】A．根据均摊法可知，该晶胞中<img src=\"chem-asset:902e2c674863db6fefc69ecbd264594c33d546752a33ef78b158b87b4525e1ee:0;\" style=\"width:28.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的个数为<img src=\"chem-asset:a10bd35bcd9bb38001028f9e78dcfd1c90ac7e19d8f7daec2bdd41fec73205c2:10;\" style=\"width:77.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，O的个数为<img src=\"chem-asset:438417e4a70c6e9414f3d8bb2a62e9317a48690b9043db6340a599f6137cf843:11;\" style=\"width:83.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，该锰氧化物的化学式为<img src=\"chem-asset:ae1d18e1336a9c3b14f4aebc67b28d9cf34b0f91d3e2333e66d5932f56820510:8;\" style=\"width:44.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，A正确；</p><p>B．<img src=\"chem-asset:48576f6a8a1401ed64111d6349a3c754e72a2aad8844509dce0bb48709dfb998:12;\" style=\"width:97.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，晶体密度<img src=\"chem-asset:5a0d9c51a054d26b07013176f29306b85ae2f42ed33f7a61f6fb851139171514:13;\" style=\"width:212.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，B错误；</p><p>C．从图中可以看出，体内的<img src=\"chem-asset:902e2c674863db6fefc69ecbd264594c33d546752a33ef78b158b87b4525e1ee:0;\" style=\"width:28.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">周围有6个等距离的O，<img src=\"chem-asset:902e2c674863db6fefc69ecbd264594c33d546752a33ef78b158b87b4525e1ee:0;\" style=\"width:28.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">位于距离最近的O构成的八面体中心，C正确；</p><p>D．当<img src=\"chem-asset:ae1d18e1336a9c3b14f4aebc67b28d9cf34b0f91d3e2333e66d5932f56820510:8;\" style=\"width:44.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">晶体中有氧原子脱出时，出现氧空位，O的化合价由-2价升为0价，失去电子，由电子守恒，<img src=\"chem-asset:902e2c674863db6fefc69ecbd264594c33d546752a33ef78b158b87b4525e1ee:0;\" style=\"width:28.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">(Ⅳ)得到电子化合价降低，D正确；</p><p>故选B。</p></div></div><p class=\"note\">原答案和解析按原内容保留，未逐题独立重解或校订。知识点及小问标签为本次整理标注。</p><details><summary>来源与核对</summary><p>D:\\高中化学\\01_资料层\\高中试卷\\2025.11.21版\\精品解析：湖南省新高考教学教研联盟2025届高三下学期第一次考试 化学试卷\\精品解析：湖南省新高考教学教研联盟2025届高三下学期第一次考试 化学试卷（解析版）.docx</p><a href=\"file:///D:/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/01_%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%B1%82/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/2025.11.21%E7%89%88/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E7%9C%81%E6%96%B0%E9%AB%98%E8%80%83%E6%95%99%E5%AD%A6%E6%95%99%E7%A0%94%E8%81%94%E7%9B%9F2025%E5%B1%8A%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E8%80%83%E8%AF%95%20%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E7%9C%81%E6%96%B0%E9%AB%98%E8%80%83%E6%95%99%E5%AD%A6%E6%95%99%E7%A0%94%E8%81%94%E7%9B%9F2025%E5%B1%8A%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E8%80%83%E8%AF%95%20%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7%EF%BC%88%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%89%88%EF%BC%89.docx\">打开原来源文件</a></details></main></body></html>","assets":["06b1d552e8e88515befaaa9de6124ccf027ef512f07bb9abce4e802fdd8dbd5b","07e95349a24a1a49e7c70b781a171a0a0528446b65fcc4c8aa0f603d24d1e236","438417e4a70c6e9414f3d8bb2a62e9317a48690b9043db6340a599f6137cf843","4642e9bca2123285e4e2e74dd064e20b9467419012146f713b136f6250fdfdf0","48576f6a8a1401ed64111d6349a3c754e72a2aad8844509dce0bb48709dfb998","5a0d9c51a054d26b07013176f29306b85ae2f42ed33f7a61f6fb851139171514","6db4e448d632d27b238af68256dce21b0c03410d62e61358032833b0a3e243e1","6e848ec32b91c7995f4ec6fe6a4a4882eac40c2344af2697f65f0b648e3eb955","902e2c674863db6fefc69ecbd264594c33d546752a33ef78b158b87b4525e1ee","a10bd35bcd9bb38001028f9e78dcfd1c90ac7e19d8f7daec2bdd41fec73205c2","ae1d18e1336a9c3b14f4aebc67b28d9cf34b0f91d3e2333e66d5932f56820510","d2f8591123eaeec6ec7e1104622c186070cdd53ac060fb859acd10a2a883e209","d8b68a9d309cf7689d828e2e60d480c3af323d5b1a71bf42f66a9f8d5efced79","fbec49c51c741f071e325b5edbac788fd198d5d57cf9ac65ed03cbe07099991d"],"sourceSha256":"7c4131a4bbf426dc3c125f51b83cf9ca096ba6c812b3716d3f673e42baab78ed"}}